Retained matches still go through compilation, exact preview and activation with restoration enabled. Hot activation checks the full bundle digest before and after preparation. The added regressions cover repeated non-idempotent backfill reactivation, native-row preservation, and aliases with defaulted and deprecated inputs under column intent. I haven’t run tests or inspected qualification outputs.
